#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Independent, offline audit of the retained 0832 performance packet.

The driver owns compilation and capture.  This reader only opens retained
files.  It does not import ``analyze.py`` or its schema helpers; it applies the
pinned allocation envelope to each raw metrics report and repeats the
arithmetic independently.  It does not run Git, launch a workload, execute a
build, or inspect a live target directory.
The arithmetic below is deliberately repeated from the raw reports so that a
second reader can detect a stale or accidentally copied analysis result.
"""

